  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nSale on now — use \"OriginSale\" at checkout.\n\nCart\nOnly for the brave\nShare\n\nWe believe the 2Unfold is a piece of art and shows our silent energy and passion. Buy it and put it on your shelf… no wait, it’s there to be used, smashed and battered - the daily grit will make it even more gorgeous.\n\nAs this premium leather is is a natural material, it will soften and age over time. The influences of sun, oil, and water develops a one of a kind patina on leather which makes every one of our products unique.\n\nUse it, abuse it, and wear it with pride. \n\nBack to blog\nOnly for the brave\nJULY 6, 2022\n\nThe premium leather will soften and age over time, developing a one of a kind patina. \n\nBack to blue\nJULY 6, 2022\n\nWe're bringing back our customer favorite premium Italian leather in a deep Ocean Blue color.\n\nMade in our studio\nJULY 6, 2022\n\nWe have been working with our hands for over 10 years now, and we're proud of where we are today.\n\nTHE UPDATES\n\nStay in the know\nEmail\nShop Journal Contact Shipping\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTikTok\nX (Twitter)\nSnapchat\nPayment methods\n© 2026, theme-origin-demo Powered by Shopify"
